                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg1481">p. 1481</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d763-f3" n="4" xml:id="d763-f3-content">
                <p>The National Resources Planning Board, established on July 1, 1939, was abolished
                    on August 31, 1943; <hi rendition="#italic">Federal Records of World War
                    II</hi>, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>: <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Civilian Agencies</hi> (Washington, Government Printing Office, 1950), pp.
                    96–97.</p>
            </note>
